1
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:04,620
- [Narrator] Every person
on Facebook is unique.

2
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:07,270
In fact, there are billions
of people on Facebook

3
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:10,190
spread across countries,
continents, and cultures,

4
00:00:10,190 --> 00:00:11,920
and no two are alike.

5
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:14,610
So it only makes sense that
the service Facebook offers

6
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:16,810
is a completely personalized experience

7
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:20,260
based on all the things
that make you, well, you.

8
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:22,760
To do this, we use
information to learn more

9
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:24,450
about the things you might be into.

10
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:27,250
This information is based
on a number of sources,

11
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:28,800
like how you use our products,

12
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:31,010
and it helps us create
a Facebook experience

13
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,080
that is built around your interests.

14
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:35,940
For example, we might use
the location you've set

15
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:37,310
as your hometown on Facebook

16
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:39,480
to recommend a local
group for you to join.

17
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:42,690
Or if we see that you liked
some South Asian food Pages,

18
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:44,610
we might suggest some specialty stores

19
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:47,360
or cookware retailers in your area.

20
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:50,730
Your information also helps us
to provide a safer experience

21
00:00:50,730 --> 00:00:53,350
for everyone using Meta
products and devices.

22
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:55,510
This includes protecting
others on Facebook

23
00:00:55,510 --> 00:00:57,600
by monitoring for harmful content.

24
00:00:57,600 --> 00:01:00,870
We also use your information
to improve your experience,

25
00:01:00,870 --> 00:01:02,700
like by making sure content is shown

26
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:05,030
in a language that's
common in your location

27
00:01:05,030 --> 00:01:06,580
or helping you grow your circle

28
00:01:06,580 --> 00:01:08,360
by suggesting new connections.

29
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:09,910
You can manage your information

30
00:01:09,910 --> 00:01:11,830
through a number of privacy controls,

31
00:01:11,830 --> 00:01:13,297
including Ad Preferences,

32
00:01:13,297 --> 00:01:16,200
Off-Facebook Activity,
and Privacy Checkup.

33
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:19,580
When it comes to your
information, we're here for you,

34
00:01:19,580 --> 00:01:20,890
and helping you understand

35
00:01:20,890 --> 00:01:22,940
how your information is collected, used,

36
00:01:22,940 --> 00:01:25,010
and shared is our responsibility.

37
00:01:25,010 --> 00:01:26,810
So whether you're messaging, posting,

38
00:01:26,810 --> 00:01:29,430
shopping, liking, or
sharing, we're committed

39
00:01:29,430 --> 00:01:31,890
to helping you have the
best experience possible

40
00:01:31,890 --> 00:01:34,053
across all of our apps and products.